    "Scouting Notes": "Likely a reliever, but did start in college\n Committed to Missouri out of Juco but had a hang up that would have caused him to sit a year\n Fastball up to 98, sits comfortably mid 90's. Could use some re shaping. Sinker shows more promise than 4S.\n Curve is sharp and has a huge difference in velo from the fastball, but inconsistent and still developing.\n Changeup doesn't kill much spin but does kill velo and has solid movement profile.\n Command needs work, but not as bad as you might expect for a raw arm.\n Crazy athletic, really interesting flier. Type of moldable arm the Brewers do well with.",
